SHOP GOOD - RESTRUCTURING SUMMARY
Project Overview
We are rebuilding a full e-commerce platform (like Jumia) to use ONE single API file (api/server.js) instead of multiple API files. All HTML files will call this centralized API instead of directly accessing Firebase.

What We've Done So Far
We have restructured 10 HTML files to use the API:

#	File	Status	API Endpoints Used
1	analytics.html	✅ DONE	GET /api/analytics
2	cart.html	✅ DONE	GET /api/cart, PUT /api/cart/update, DELETE /api/cart/remove
3	category.html	✅ DONE	GET /api/categories/:id, GET /api/categories/:id/products
4	checkout.html	✅ DONE	POST /api/orders/create, GET /api/payments/verify, POST /api/orders/:id/confirm, POST /api/orders/:id/pay-with-wallet
